# POSDATAMX Digital Platform

Web development project created as part of my professional residency in Computer Systems Engineering.

The project focused on the digital reengineering of the POSDATAMX corporate website, transforming the existing platform into a more dynamic, maintainable, multilingual, and administrable web application.

## 🚀 Main Features
Dynamic corporate website
Backend development with Node.js and Express
Database integration with MongoDB
Spanish and English multilingual support
Administrative panel for content management
Dynamic content management using JSON configuration files
SEO optimization and metadata management
Chatbot functionality
WhatsApp integration and automation
Responsive web design
Integration with external services and APIs

## 🛠️ Technologies
Backend
Node.js
Express.js
MongoDB
Mongoose
REST APIs
Frontend
HTML5
CSS3
JavaScript
EJS
Tailwind CSS
Tools & Services
Git / GitHub
MongoDB Atlas
Google Analytics
Google Search Console
WhatsApp Web integration

## 📁 Project Structure

The application follows a server-side web architecture using Express and EJS, with separate components for routes, configuration, static resources, database services, translations, and administrative functionality.

Multilingual content is managed through configuration files, allowing the website to dynamically display content in English or Spanish.

## 🎯 Project Objectives

The main objectives of the project were to:

Modernize the company's existing digital platform.
Improve website maintainability and scalability.
Centralize content management.
Provide multilingual support.
Improve SEO and online visibility.
Integrate database-driven functionality.
Automate selected communication and administrative processes.

## 🎓 Academic Context

This project was developed during my Professional Residency as part of the Computer Systems Engineering program at the Instituto Tecnológico de Nuevo Laredo.

The project provided practical experience in full-stack web development, database integration, API integration, automation, SEO, and deployment of a real-world corporate platform.

